# Context exclusions for docker/site.Dockerfile only. BuildKit reads the
# <dockerfile>.dockerignore file next to the Dockerfile, so the proofs and
# gateway images keep their own context rules.
#
# demo/ and protocol/ are excluded outright: the legacy pages they fed are gone
# and the Dockerfile no longer copies either tree.
.git
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
web/dist
web/public/legacy
demo
protocol
contracts/out
contracts/cache
.venv
.pio
